#!/bin/sh
cat << 'HELP'

  WraithOS Quick Reference
  ─────────────────────────

  System:
    rauc status              → gak tersedia (custom A/B)
    cat /proc/cmdline        → cek slot aktif (slot=A atau B)
    mount | grep 'on / '     → cek rootfs

  Orchestrator:
    wget -qO- http://127.0.0.1:9090/healthz
    wget -qO- http://127.0.0.1:9090/metrics
    wget -qO- http://127.0.0.1:9090/debug/state
    cat /var/lib/orchestrator/wraith.log   → log

  Modules:
    ls /modules                              → daftar modul
    wraith list                              → list via CLI (kalau ada binary)

  Update:
    wraith-update /path/to/rootfs.squashfs   → update ke slot lain
    rm /boot/boot_b && reboot                → rollback ke A
    ls /boot/                                → cek marker

  Persistent data:
    /data/orchestrator   → DB, logs
    /data/modules        → Wasm modul
    /data/wraith         → config

HELP
